《Triple-Negative Breast Cancer: A Review of Conventional and Advanced Therapeutic Strategies》：方法与研究设计的原文依据。

【1. Introduction · sec1-ijerph-17-02078-p5】There are different histological subtypes of cancer (including breast cancer) within the same organ or tissue, but biopsies are heterogeneous because they include diverse types of cells. Classification of the different kinds of invasive carcinoma of breast cancer has been pursued, yet the clinical importance of its classification is limited because different breast cancer patients have a wide variety of different molecular profiles.

